{"agent":"Monster3-NV-next-tag-filter-7267fe","data":{"by":"Qwen/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-FP8","evidence":{"chunk_findings":[{"chunk":3,"detail":"When `--lane` is used, `_next` computes `tags = _tags(a)` but then calls `_api().next_lane(...)` without passing `tags`, while the non-lane path passes `tags=tags` to `next_item`. Thus `ddflow next --lane L --tag wave:3` (or `--wave 3`) accepts the tag filter but the lane answer is produced from the unfiltered lane candidate set, so an item lacking `wave:3` can still be offered; this violates the stated falsifier that no item without the requested tag may appear in ready/blocked.","digest":"e3d502b207d695a3","family":"alibaba","location":"ddflow/surfaces/declared/lifecycle/navigate.py:_next","malformed":"","reviewer":"[REDACTED:name]","severity":"HIGH","title":"ddflow/surfaces/declared/lifecycle/navigate.py:_next"},{"chunk":4,"detail":"The queue fixture creates no dependency relationships, so the normal `next` output for this fixture has an empty `blocked` list. The assertion `all(b[\"item\"] in {\"M.A\", \"M.B\"} for b in d[\"blocked\"])` is therefore vacuously true and does not demonstrate that blocked items are filtered by `--tag`; if the implementation failed to filter blocked items in a queue that does have blocked tasks, this test would still pass. This contradicts the stated test goal that ready and blocked items are limited to the tag.","digest":"5e6bbfeccacfdfb7","family":"alibaba","location":"tests/test_next_tag_filter.py:test_tag_limits_ready_and_blocked","malformed":"","reviewer":"[REDACTED:name]","severity":"LOW","title":"tests/test_next_tag_filter.py:test_tag_limits_ready_and_blocked"},{"chunk":2,"detail":"`--tag` / `--wave` are parsed into `tags` and passed only on the no-lane path. `ddflow next --lane L --tag x` (or `--wave 0`) still calls `next_lane` without those tags, so an item that does not carry the tag is offered whenever it is next on that lane. The flags are accepted and then dropped, which is a silent wrong answer rather than a refusal.","digest":"c3af1706a313f621","family":"xai","location":"ddflow/surfaces/declared/lifecycle/navigate.py:_next","malformed":"","reviewer":"grok-4.7","severity":"MEDIUM","title":"ddflow/surfaces/declared/lifecycle/navigate.py:_next"}],"chunks_total":2,"coverage":"2/2 chunk(s) reviewed","delta_rounds":0,"diff_chars":13744,"diff_sha":"e564b4ea0f5dc9942c387afb6390316f250aff81240980e0b7de57dfc6d7f94e","diff_source":"main..HEAD + tracked working-tree changes in $HOME/src/ddflow/.ddflow/worktrees/NV-next-tag-filter","diff_stat":{"deletions":0,"files":0,"insertions":0,"untracked":0},"elapsed_s":13.6,"family":"alibaba","findings":3,"max_chunk_chars":12000,"model":"[REDACTED:name]","output_digest":"d3453e8181e22fb5","output_file":".ddflow/local/reviews/NV-next-tag-filter.rubber_duck.gemini-3.5-flash-lite.20261112T143940Z-e19ceced.jsonl","reason":"","review_kind":"full","reviewed":[1,2],"reviewed_for_holder":"[REDACTED:hostname]-NV-next-tag-filter-7267fe reviewed lane-next-view's NV-next-tag-filter","reviewed_head":"aec3f088c245fecbe38bae0a0051464b32031736","reviewed_paths":{"ddflow/api/lifecycle/planning.py":"100644 16ca86f1a1bd7ee3db0983b18fc9a3dd6d888e08","ddflow/api/lifecycle/ready.py":"100644 21b1a92a2ca8f7db80ff08e91f0700d6945e4a76","ddflow/core/schedule/__init__.py":"100644 463b9aac30751eec7ce5209bc1211f4428b35959","ddflow/core/schedule/_plan.py":"100644 fd63115f8244a1c83f39e419181a128095325448","ddflow/surfaces/declared/lifecycle/navigate.py":"100644 8111f0029662bf616457f47a45e310421fcbead8","ddflow/templates/prompts/help/workflow.md":"100644 eb7d72e94671e97e169c2d25c250c5b6d4c0a5ed","tests/test_next_tag_filter.py":"100644 6f324ec9e472015567c7c3b5b7c09eaa1df63286"},"reviewer":"[REDACTED:name]","reviewer_digest":"3926c0df5644d7de","reviewer_families":["alibaba","google","xai"],"round":1,"rounds":1,"status":"REVIEWED","titles":["ddflow/surfaces/declared/lifecycle/navigate.py:_next","tests/test_next_tag_filter.py:test_tag_limits_ready_and_blocked","ddflow/surfaces/declared/lifecycle/navigate.py:_next"],"tree_sha":"4ee9fd72b735+clean","unreviewed":[],"waves":1},"gate":"rubber_duck","reason":"3 finding(s)"},"id":"ec8a1070976d7474fc46aa2e4","kind":"gate.failed","lamport":184135,"schema":1,"subject":"NV-next-tag-filter","ts":"2026-11-12T14:41:21.827134Z"}
